SQLCipher and OpenSSL, in sqlcipher3-binary
-------------------------------------------
The Python package sqlcipher3-binary bundles SQLCipher, which encrypts the books,
and OpenSSL, which SQLCipher uses.

  SQLCipher, Copyright (c) Zetetic LLC, BSD-style license.
  Source: https://github.com/sqlcipher/sqlcipher
  OpenSSL, Apache License 2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/openssl/openssl

The package itself is on PyPI as sqlcipher3-binary.


PDFium, in pypdfium2
--------------------
The Python package pypdfium2 bundles PDFium, which reads PDF files.

  PDFium, BSD-3-Clause and Apache License 2.0, Copyright The PDFium Authors.
  Source: https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/
  pypdfium2: https://github.com/pypdfium2-team/pypdfium2


