Data sources
------------
The tables under src/steward/engine/data/ are copied or derived from these
published sources. SOURCES.md in that folder gives each file, its date and the
rule for it.

  SSA (Social Security Administration): national average wage index, benefit
    formula bend points, contribution and benefit base, life table, Trustees
    Report summary, and the early and late retirement and spousal pages.
    https://www.ssa.gov/oact/cola/AWI.html
    https://www.ssa.gov/oact/STATS/table4c6.html
    https://www.ssa.gov/oact/TRSUM/index.html
  Aswath Damodaran, Stern School of Business, New York University: Historical
    Returns on Stocks, Bonds and Bills.
    https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/New_Home_Page/datafile/histretSP.html
    https://www.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/pc/datasets/histretSP.xls
  College Board: Trends in College Pricing and Student Aid.
    https://research.collegeboard.org/trends/college-pricing
  CareScout (Genworth): Cost of Care Survey.
    https://assets.carescout.com/x/8fcb50422f/282102.pdf
  A Place for Mom: Senior Living Cost Planner.
    https://www.aplaceformom.com/senior-living-cost-planner
  Internal Revenue Service, California Franchise Tax Board, CMS and DHCS
    publications: named in each rules/*.json table.


